# 1.2 MB of per-file symbol counts, regenerable and pinned to one SHA. The
# committed artifact is the REPORT beside it (outline-symbols-ab.txt); rebuild
# the baseline in a worktree at the SHA the report names:
#   bun run scripts/bench/ab/outline-symbols-ab.ts --save <path>
scripts/bench/results/outline-symbols-baseline.json

# `makepkg -si` run in place (what README tells Arch users to do) drops its
# build tree and downloads here. Ignored from the repo root on purpose, not from
# a .gitignore inside the package dir: that directory is mirrored verbatim into
# the AUR repository, so a file added there would be published.
packaging/aur/claudin-bin/src/
packaging/aur/claudin-bin/pkg/
packaging/aur/claudin-bin/*.pkg.tar.*
packaging/aur/claudin-bin/*.tar.gz
packaging/aur/claudin-bin/LICENSE-*
